{"id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-recursively-enumerable.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable","display":"df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","aliases":["57-df-recursively-enumerable"],"display":"df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable","depends_on":["[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","[[57-df-W-e]]","[[57-df-phi-e]]","[[57-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-recursively-enumerable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-recursively-enumerable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursively-enumerable — Recursively Enumerable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6a5ff61521a8f18\" href=\"?note=d6a5ff61521a8f18\" title=\"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1118344012e3e87\" href=\"?note=b1118344012e3e87\" title=\"57-df-W-e\">57-df-W-e</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"150af883bccb8887\" href=\"?note=150af883bccb8887\" title=\"57-df-phi-e\">57-df-phi-e</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6a5ff61521a8f18\" href=\"?note=d6a5ff61521a8f18\" title=\"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a> 的<strong>数值集合类</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b1118344012e3e87\" href=\"?note=b1118344012e3e87\" title=\"57-df-W-e\">57-df-W-e</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"150af883bccb8887\" href=\"?note=150af883bccb8887\" title=\"57-df-phi-e\">57-df-phi-e</a> 的同一程序编号；自然数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A=W_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A=W_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ (A=W_e)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}(A)\\longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RE}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ (A=W_e)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}(A)\\longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原接口和定义域刻画保留，改正它对“语法公式类”文件的错误依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-W-e","status":"resolved","id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-W-e]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-phi-e","status":"resolved","id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-phi-e]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Sigma_1^0$ 使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的**数值集合类**。$W_e$、$\\varphi_e$ 是 [[57-df-W-e]]、[[57-df-phi-e]] 的同一程序编号；自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-W-e","status":"resolved","id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Sigma_1^0$ 使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的**数值集合类**。$W_e$、$\\varphi_e$ 是 [[57-df-W-e]]、[[57-df-phi-e]] 的同一程序编号；自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-phi-e","status":"resolved","id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Sigma_1^0$ 使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的**数值集合类**。$W_e$、$\\varphi_e$ 是 [[57-df-W-e]]、[[57-df-phi-e]] 的同一程序编号；自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\Sigma_1^0$ 使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的**数值集合类**。$W_e$、$\\varphi_e$ 是 [[57-df-W-e]]、[[57-df-phi-e]] 的同一程序编号；自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^0","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\Sigma_1^0\\leftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A=W_e).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ (A=W_e)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}(A)\\longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{RE}.","display":true}],"bytes":930,"backlinks":[{"id":"8be923caff92504f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$W_e$ 取 [[57-df-W-e]] 的同一自然数编号，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Creative}$ 保留原定义中的 $W_e\\subseteq A$ 条件；不将它替换为补集上的生产函数条件或真包含。$K$ 是下式的相关编号集合。"},{"id":"f09872a0e6f9cd1a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为固定有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$g[\\Phi]$ 为直接像；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[57-df-mod]]。"},{"id":"bca56618509beeda","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma^0_1$ (r.e.集类, see [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]])"},{"id":"f6f85367d1780fad","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$。$\\mathrm{SO}$ 使用完全二阶语义。固定二阶有限语法树的有效单射编码 $g:\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$：编码像可判定，各构造子及识别、取子树运算可计算。$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 是固定具有可计算逆的可计算双射。证明系统 $\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$ 表示证书编号与结论编号的关系；$\\mathrm{RE}$ 为 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]] 的数集类。下述 Sound、Complete 均相对这些固定数据定义；不对任意不可有效枚举的公理真类宣称不可能性。"},{"id":"b0fcfc053ad38255","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为有限的一阶关系语言并至少含一个二元关系符号；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$|\\mathfrak A|$ 表示结构的载体，$\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|$ 表示基数。$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]]，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。"},{"id":"4a894c201e15cf14","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]]。"},{"id":"536f78c4d1ada7bd","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[57-df-equality-left]]\n[[57-df-equality-right]]\n[[57-df-